//
// TEMPLATE OVERVIEW (grep: "4-BLOCK" | "SETUP" | "BODY" | "CLOSING")
//
// This is the CODE TEMPLATE for 4-block executable/library files.
// Implements universal.omni patterns specifically for code that runs.
//
// 4-BLOCK STRUCTURE: METADATA → SETUP → BODY → CLOSING
//   METADATA: Identity, grounding, interface, operational context
//   SETUP:    Inputs, definitions, infrastructure
//   BODY:     Organization, helpers, core operations, APIs
//   CLOSING:  Verification, modification policy, synthesis
//
// CHAIN (grep: "derives from" | "documented at"):
//   syntax.omni → universal.omni → code.omni (this file) → [format].go/.c/.sh
//
// SECTIONS (grep: "keyed as" | "grounded in" | "inputs of" | "operations of")
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

